hildren: Adam Palmer, Avra Douglas, and Jod Douglas.\\n\\nMartel died at age 78 of a heart attack on August 12, 2014 in Santa Monica, California. She had battled breast cancer some years earlier. - Actress\\n\\n- Writer\\n\\n- Additional Crew\\n\\nShirley Temple was ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.imdb.com/search/name/?death_date=2014\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d57\"},\"ref\":\"d57\",\"snippet\":\" ... He was married a total of seven times, and fathered eight children.\\n\\nAfter long battles with ill health, Richard Pryor passed away on December 10th, 2005.- Vincent Schiavelli, selected in 1997 by Vanity Fair as one of the best character actors in America, had made over 120 film ... \",\"title\":\"https://m.imdb.com/search/name/?death_date=2005&ref_=nmbio\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d58\"},\"ref\":\"d58\",\"snippet\":\" ... died in California on June 29, 2023 at the age of 89. He is survived by his three sons - Adam, Matthew, and Anthony Dana Arkin, and with Dana, Alan Arkin is survived by third wife, Suzanne Newlander Arkin, whom he married in 1999.- Actor\\n\\n- Soundtrack\\n\\nPopular British character ... \",\"title\":\"https://m.imdb.com/search/name/?death_date=2023&ref_=nmbio_dth_yr\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d59\"},\"ref\":\"d59\",\"snippet\":\" ... He is survived by his wife Kelly Rizzo and his three children.\\n\\nDwayne Hickman\\n\\nDwayne Hickman, the TV executive and actor best known for his role as girl-infatuated teen Dobie Gillis in the CBS sitcom The Many Loves of Dobie Gillis, died on Jan. 9 from complications ... \",\"title\":\"https://ew.com/celebrity/stars-we-lost-in-2022/?srsltid=AfmBOoqgtseDJPvB8Bamfe3oZlhWJZaiC5kf4fxP0pjffkBximQEpPNy\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d60\"},\"ref\":\"d60\",\"snippet\":\" ... Married and divorced three times, Arlene had three children: Adam Palmer, Avra Douglas, and Jod Douglas.\\n\\nMartel died at age 78 of a heart attack on August 12, 2014 in Santa Monica, California. She had battled breast cancer some years earlier. - Hailing from Long Beach, California, talented character ... \",\"title\":\"https://m.imdb.com/search/name/?birth_year=1936&ref_=nmbio_bth_yr\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"da5324741fc289e87bb16d113abeb5468f46f2324ce0e57d739d46d5a8ad3ad8\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"76e6d12aa85b239b340cfa0a150ec007cfb172f1cb9b8311f95ce6cef5d0c930\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"character married three times children died only one survives TV drama\",\"view\":\"full\"}]}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_ca6190c5baff4084a8506ca8"},{"content":"{\"action_slot_charged\":true,\"executed\":true,\"ok\":true,\"results\":[{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d61\"},\"ref\":\"d61\",\"snippet\":\" ... Meredith Grey, Grey's Anatomy follows the drama and romance at Seattle Grace Mercy West Hospital, later renamed Grey Sloan Memorial Hospital. Although the show outgrew its main character in Season 19, it's still going strong with 21 seasons and counting. When it first aired, its cast ... \",\"title\":\"https://movieweb.com/most-watched-tv-shows-2000s/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d62\"},\"ref\":\"d62\",\"snippet\":\" ... Drama Series (Grey's Anatomy), Screen Actors Guild (2006)\\n\\n- Outstanding Performance by an Ensemble in a Drama Series (Grey's Anatomy), Screen Actors Guild (2007)\\n\\n- ACTRA Award of Excellence, ACTRA (2009)\\n\\n- Favorite TV Character We Miss Most (Dr. Christina Yang, Grey's Anatomy), People's Choice Awards (2015 ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.thecanadianencyclopedia.ca/en/article/sandra-oh\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d44\"},\"ref\":\"d44\",\"snippet\":\" ... While there have been many other dramas that lasted for more than a decade, such as the aforementioned Grey's Anatomy, Law & Order's 23 seasons plus multiple spin-offs demonstrate the true grip it has on viewers.\\n\\nReality TV: Survivor, 46 seasons\\n\\nAn American Family, a 12 ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.bbc.com/culture/article/20240318-longest-running-tv-shows-programmes-series-ever\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d63\"},\"ref\":\"d63\",\"snippet\":\" ... Knight spent most of his time on Broadway in shows like 2001's Noises Off and 2003's Tartuffe prior to his television career taking off.\\n\\nNow: Knight left Grey's Anatomy after season 5 for multiple reasons, and he went back to the stage for Off Broadway ... \",\"title\":\"https://ew.com/gallery/greys-anatomy-cast-before-they-were-stars/?srsltid=AfmBOop9veMvemNQBxOptWObS-iC49SGiFhqZjNBzk87cYVuzqnbjT2L\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d64\"},\"ref\":\"d64\",\"snippet\":\" ... He later appeared in episodes of Friends (1994), Grey's Anatomy (2005) and Crazylove (2005).\\n\\nHe has been married three times (most recently to Angela Imperato since 2000) and has three children.\\n\\nValerie Landsburg as Doris Schwartz\\n\\nValerie Landsburg became a globally-recognized star playing Doris Schwartz in ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.yahoo.com/lifestyle/fame-tv-show-cast-see-151938446.html\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d65\"},\"ref\":\"d65\",\"snippet\":\" ... 2005-present\\n\\nGrey's Anatomy\\n\\nBecause we all need our \\\"person.\\\"\\n\\nMore tears have been shed over \\\"Grey's Anatomy\\\" than any other prime time drama. It's been on longer than almost anything else, and it's also embraced tragedy, plucked heartstrings and leaned hard into wrenching ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.nytimes.com/interactive/2019/arts/television/best-drama-series.html\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d66\"},\"ref\":\"d66\",\"snippet\":\" ... 7. \\\"Grey's Anatomy\\\" (2005-present): The soapy series is the second-longest running medical drama after \\\"ER,\\\" and if nothing else, it deserves our appreciation for bringing Patrick Dempsey back into our lives on a weekly basis as Dr. Derek \\\"McDreamy\\\" Shepherd. (Spoken like a true '80s ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.oklahoman.com/story/entertainment/columns/brandy-mcdonnell/2018/08/01/great-medical-shows-television-writers-have-been-prescribing-healthy-dose-hospital-drama-for-decades/60510384007/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d67\"},\"ref\":\"d67\",\"snippet\":\" ... Meredith Grey. Over the years, Grey's Anatomy has consistently pushed boundaries, tackling sensitive issues such as race, gender, and mental health. Garnering multiple Emmy and Golden Globe nominations, this long-running series continues to be a beloved staple in the realm of medical dramas.\\n\\n- Actors: Ellen Pompeo ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.ranker.com/list/best-2000s-medical-tv-shows/ranker-tv\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"c2358152e036c5de7ce3de341bbd9b4a3de156a0ccb9b6b8c072d81c48d24997\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"ba7dc2cde97090c2d88a611ee496825a1d9b0d837f1b8c028e2473050c5e6e87\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"Grey's Anatomy character married multiple times children\",\"view\":\"full\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d5\"},\"ref\":\"d5\",\"snippet\":\" ... Characters\\n\\nMajor Characters\\n\\n* Mariam, an ethnic Tajik born in Herat in 1959. The illegitimate child of Jalil and Nana, his housekeeper, she suffers shame throughout her life due to the circumstances of her birth, and is forced to marry a much older shoemaker and move to Kabul after ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/A_Thousand_Splendid_Suns\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d1\"},\"ref\":\"d1\",\"snippet\":\" ... Supporting character Iris Cobb was married three times, and all three of her husbands predeceased her — her first one (and the father of her only son) died of food poisoning, C. C. Cobb was murdered in the book where he and Iris were introduced, and Herb Hackpole died ... \",\"title\":\"https://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/CartwrightCurse\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d68\"},\"ref\":\"d68\",\"snippet\":\" ... Mary